# AI PR Bot Rules

## Git Conventions

- Branch: `feature/`, `fix/`, `chore/` prefix
- Commit: Conventional Commits format
- PR: Single-focus, split large PRs

## Bot Behavior

- Never log tokens/secrets
- Respect API rate limits
- Return meaningful message on error
